                          text ", proposed and prototyped " 40 9739 172 16 serif 16
                          text "ENQUIRE" 212 9739 56 16 serif 16 underline link 355
                          text ", a system for CERN" 268 9739 124 16 serif 16
                        line 8 9757 384 20 base 14
                          text "researchers to use and share documents. In 1989," 8 9759 324 16 serif 16
                        line 8 9777 384 20 base 14
                          span a 276 9779 52 16 link 356
                          text "Berners-Lee wrote a memo proposing an " 8 9779 268 16 serif 16
                          text "Internet" 276 9779 52 16 serif 16 underline link 356
