                          text "4" 131 9801 6 13 serif 13 underline link 358
                          text "]" 137 9801 7 13 serif 13 underline link 358
                          text " Berners-Lee specified HTML and" 144 9799 216 16 serif 16
                        line 8 9817 384 20 base 14
                          text "wrote the browser and server software in late 1990. That" 8 9819 360 16 serif 16
                        line 8 9837 384 20 base 14
