                          text "Cailliau" 8 9859 48 16 serif 16 underline link 360
                          text " collaborated on a joint request for funding, but the" 56 9859 324 16 serif 16
                        line 8 9877 384 20 base 14
                          text "project was not formally adopted by CERN. In his personal" 8 9879 376 16 serif 16
                        line 8 9897 384 20 base 14
