                        line 8 10209 384 20 base 14
                          text "visible or audible web pages. Default characteristics for" 8 10211 360 16 serif 16
                        line 8 10229 384 20 base 14
                          text "every item of HTML markup are defined in the browser, and" 8 10231 380 16 serif 16
                        line 8 10249 384 20 base 14
