                        block dd 48 14640 344 240
                          line 48 14640 344 20 base 14
                            text "On 14 February 2011, the W3C extended the charter of" 48 14642 332 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14660 344 20 base 14
                            text "its HTML Working Group with clear milestones for" 48 14662 316 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14680 344 20 base 14
                            text "HTML5. In May 2011, the working group advanced" 48 14682 320 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14700 344 20 base 14
                            text "HTML5 to \"Last Call\", an invitation to communities" 48 14702 328 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14720 344 20 base 14
                            text "inside and outside W3C to confirm the technical" 48 14722 308 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14740 344 20 base 14
                            text "soundness of the specification. The W3C developed" 48 14742 336 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14760 344 20 base 14
                            text "a comprehensive test suite to achieve broad" 48 14762 288 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14780 344 20 base 14
                            text "interoperability for the full specification by 2014," 48 14782 308 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14800 344 20 base 14
                            span span 352 14804 7 13
