                        text "The HTML Living Standard, which is developed by" 8 32510 324 16 serif 16
                      line 8 32528 384 20 base 14
                        text "WHATWG, is the official version, while W3C HTML5 is no" 8 32530 360 16 serif 16
                      line 8 32548 384 20 base 14
                        text "longer separate from WHATWG." 8 32550 196 16 serif 16
                  block section 8 32588 384 720
                    block div 8 32588 384 30
                      block h2 8 32588 384 30
                        line 8 32588 384 30 base 21
                          text "WYSIWYG editors" 8 32591 168 24 serif 24 bold
